[I] Library that extends GTK with common widgets and utilities

[T] Library that extends GTK with common widgets and utilities

[U] https://github.com/elementary/granite/

[A] elementary
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/development
[F] CROSS

[E] opt dejavu-ttf-fonts
[E] opt encodings
[E] opt font-alias font-util fontconfig freefonts
[E] opt graphviz
[E] opt xorgproto

[L] LGPL3
[V] 7.8.1

[D] 53bedbd2c2dd3fc096496a71f2df406b69e70f45446e6026030455dd granite-7.8.1.tar.gz https://github.com/elementary/granite/archive/7.8.1/

. $base/package/*/*/gnome-conf.in

var_append mesonopt ' ' -Ddemo=false
pkginstalled gobject-introspection || var_append mesonopt ' ' -Dintrospection=false
pkginstalled gtk-doc docbook-xml docbook-xsl && var_append mesonopt ' ' -Ddocumentation=true
